        "texto": "See also Proverbs 19:13. Reference is undoubtedly made here to the frequent leaks to which the flat roofs of Eastern houses are subject. Having merely a covering of earth, rolled smooth and hard (see note on Psa. 129:6 #452), a heavy rain will soon succeed in finding its way thro…"
